      "name": "Card's Galore",
      "slug": "cards-galore",
      "teaser": "Can you collect all the cards?\r\nBase Set Of 100 Cards To Find!\r\n55 Suggested Community Cards to Find!",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/3012.png",
      "downloads": 5374,
      "favourites_count": 0,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Mod Description</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>~ Intro ~</strong></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.ibb.co/RGfS3tk7/53268c36-52ce-45e2-b5cb-8d1865dbde89.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/RGfS3tk7/53268c36-52ce-45e2-b5cb-8d1865dbde89.png\" alt=\"53268c36-52ce-45e2-b5cb-8d1865dbde89.png\" /></a></p>\n<p><strong>﻿~ ﻿Included in this mod ~</strong></p>\n<p>100 Photocards<br />\n- Feel Free To Comment Suggestions for more card themes! -</p>\n<p>1 Card Case - Found On The Flea</p>\n<p>(These must be found in raid!, you can not buy these from traders or the flea market!)</p>\n<p>All Card Prices Are Randomized - No Card rarity’s</p>\n<p>Found Via</p>\n<p>Scavs / Players</p>\n<p>Dead Scav Bodies</p>\n<p>Duffle Bags</p>\n<p>Jackets</p>\n<p>Drawers</p>\n<p>Toolboxes</p>\n<p>Safes</p>\n<p><em>~ Recommend Mod ~</em></p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2768-allthelootredux\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">ALL THE LOOT REDUX</a></p>\n<p><em><strong>~ Known Issues ~</strong></em></p>\n<p>None</p>\n<p><em>~ WIP ~</em><br />\nHall Of Fame Placement</p>\n<p>Card DLC’s More Themed Card Packs</p>\n<p><strong>~ Screenies ~</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.ibb.co/xt1MJdQK/Screenshot-2025-09-07-034227.png\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/xt1MJdQK/Screenshot-2025-09-07-034227.png\" alt=\"Screenshot-2025-09-07-034227.png\" /></a></strong></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Closer Card Looks</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.ibb.co/PGLcWDq0/Screenshot-2025-09-07-165905.png\" r