m/MrPenguin5292\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.patreon.com/MrPenguin5292</a></p>\n<p>(This is not needed, but it helps keep the train going!)</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://img.wattpad.com/f93ffc10270c1438c0035f2f3a13d1b00a161cff/68747470733a2f2f73332e616d617a6f6e6177732e636f6d2f776174747061642d6d656469612d736572766963652f53746f7279496d6167652f647038763734706e61474b5075513d3d2d313131393533343731372e313735303166643537373338383062653939393932303336313836322e676966\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://img.wattpad.com/f93ffc10270c1438c0035f2f3a13d1b00a161cff/68747470733a2f2f73332e616d617a6f6e6177732e636f6d2f776174747061642d6d656469612d736572766963652f53746f7279496d6167652f647038763734706e61474b5075513d3d2d313131393533343731372e313735303166643537373338383062653939393932303336313836322e676966\" alt=\"68747470733a2f2f73332e616d617a6f6e6177732e636f6d2f776174747061642d6d656469612d736572766963652f53746f7279496d6167652f647038763734706e61474b5075513d3d2d313131393533343731372e313735303166643537373338383062653939393932303336313836322e676966\" /></a></p>\n<p>SSH - Framework and tons of help<br />\nVarious Artists - Too Many To Credit Bushtail - Hall Of Fame Code<br />\nQwertyalex - Booster Pack code {.endtabset}</p></div></div></div>\n",
